# LegalityErrorsPopover

Responsive popover for deck validation failures on the "Not Legal" badge (deck editor).
- `LegalityErrorsPopover.tsx` — desktop hover/focus; mobile press-and-hold with click suppression.
- `LegalityErrorsPopover.css` — dark elevated panel, red error bullets, `z-index: 9999`; mobile portals a bounded panel to `document.body` and anchors it below the trigger.
